     "units": "s/m",
     "description": "Cell mean of 1/u, the average InMAP takes over the wind rose rather than the reciprocal of the mean speed. Length 596444 (N_ALL), layer-major over all 27 model layers; read in full because plume rise gathers it at whichever layer a stack top sits in."
    },
    "WindSpeedMinusThird": {
