    },
    "S1": {
     "file_variable": "S1",
     "units": "1/s^2",
     "description": "Stability parameter S1 = (g/theta) dtheta/dz, the buoyancy frequency squared that scales the stable-plume rise. Length 596444 (N_ALL), layer-major over all 27 model layers; read in full because plume rise gathers it at whichever layer a stack top sits in."
    },
