    "temp_diff": {
     "type": "observed",
     "units": "1",
     "shape": [
      "emis_records"
     ],
     "expression": {
      "op": "aggregate",
      "output_idx": [
       "r"
      ],
      "ranges": {
       "r": {
        "from": "emis_records"
       }
      },
      "args": [
       "stk_temp",
       "air_temp"
      ],
      "expr": {
       "op": "/",
       "args": [
        {
         "op": "*",
         "args": [
          2.0,
          {
           "op": "-",
           "args": [
            {
             "op": "index",
             "args": [
              "stk_temp",
              "r"
             ]
            },
            {
             "op": "index",
             "args": [
              "air_temp",
              "r"
             ]
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "op": "ifelse",
         "args": [
          {
           "op": "==",
           "args": [
            {
             "op": "+",
             "args": [
              {
               "op": "index",
               "args": [
                "stk_temp",
                "r"
               ]
              },
              {
               "op": "index",
               "args": [
                "air_temp",
                "r"
               ]
              }
             ]
            },
            0.0
           ]
          },
          1.0,
          {
           "op": "+",
           "args": [
            {
             "op": "index",
             "args": [
              "stk_temp",
              "r"
             ]
            },
            {
             "op": "index",
             "args": [
              "air_temp",
              "r"
             ]
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     },
     "description": "The symmetrised stack/air temperature contrast 2(Ts-Ta)/(Ts+Ta) that calcDeltaHPrecomputed uses \u2014 NOT calcDeltaH's (Ts-Ta)/Ts; InMAP calls the precomputed one. The denominator is guarded rather than the whole quotient branched, because `ifelse` is EAGER inside an aggregate in every binding and Python's division is plain scalar division, so a 1/0 in an UNTAKEN branch would still abort the build. Guarding gives 0/1 = 0 when Ts == Ta, which is exactly InMAP's special case, with no second branch. A separate observed rather than an inlined subtree because there is no CSE on the observed-field path: repeating it would cost repeated evaluations, not just bytes."
