     "description": "Per-receptor secondary organic aerosol response from the emissions that reach layer 0: sum_s SR_SOA_L0[s,rcv]*E_VOC_L0[s] (pre-fact). A PLAIN TWO-FACTOR product summed over one contracted index, one observed per (pathway, layer) \u2014 folding the three layers into a single aggregate would make the rewrite's matvec detector reject this body (it requires op `*` with exactly two args) and drop the pathway from the SR gate silently."
